                        <tr>
                           <th>Conclusion and Recommendations based on this report and previous findings known to us</th>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                           <td>CD3+CD4+ (T4 helper) cell count is within the normal range, indicating no evidence of CD4+ T-cell lymphopenia. No laboratory abnormalities detected in this result; immune status appears adequate from this parameter. Clinical correlation is recommended if immunodeficiency is suspected.</td>
